00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.230
'Cause you go there, you don't compromise.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.540
You're such a bad ass.

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:53.580
- You know, I agree.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.520
