00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:14.470
- What's so amazing is in
that very same episode,

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:17.870
you will break my heart
and make me emotional.

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:21.230
You know, when you talk
about your grandma,

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:24.720
and you did grow up in
Queens with your grandma,

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:28.520
