that time of your life?

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:33.280
- She was definitely not, you
know, your ordinary parent.

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:36.480
I think like, you know,
she really kind of noticed

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:39.060
