00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.030
I feel like I don't fit in.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:46.180
I feel like, you know, people
think certain things about me

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.730
and I just feel weird.

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:51.620
And she always told me
the weirdness in you

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.450
