gonna make you different

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:54.490
and what's gonna make you special.

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:55.730
She always told me that.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.160
You know, she was always a big fan,

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.810
but she was also, you know,

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:02.540
