00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.973
So I don't gotta pay like
10 bucks to get you in.

00:04:24.263 --> 00:04:25.096
(Awkwafina laughs)

00:04:25.096 --> 00:04:26.560
- I love that story so much.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:28.930
